@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 创建仅含选择题的考试；整套验收不会调用 DeepSeek
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "里程碑 B 人工审核验收",
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionNo": 1,
      "questionType": "CHOICE",
      "content": "HTTP 默认端口是哪一个？",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "referenceAnswer": "80"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("reviewExamId", response.body.id);
  client.global.set("reviewQuestionId", response.body.questions[0].id);
%}

### 2. 创建结构化答卷
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exams/{{reviewExamId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNo": "review-{{$random.uuid}}",
  "studentName": "人工审核验收学生",
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": {{reviewQuestionId}},
      "answerText": "80"
    }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("reviewSubmissionId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. 自动评分；记录 resultId 和服务端当前 version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{reviewSubmissionId}}/grading

> {%
  client.global.set("reviewResultId", response.body.results[0].id);
  client.global.set("initialReviewVersion", response.body.results[0].version);
%}

### 4. 查询审核材料；应含题目、标准答案、学生答案、建议分、理由和 version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{reviewSubmissionId}}/results

### 5. 接受建议分；预期 actualScore=5、reviewStatus=CONFIRMED、version 递增
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{reviewResultId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "ACCEPT_SUGGESTION",
  "expectedVersion": {{initialReviewVersion}}
}

> {% client.global.set("confirmedReviewVersion", response.body.version); %}

### 6. 使用最新版本纠正实际分；建议分和理由不得改变
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{reviewResultId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 4.50,
  "expectedVersion": {{confirmedReviewVersion}}
}

> {% client.global.set("revisedReviewVersion", response.body.version); %}

### 7. 使用旧版本再次修改；预期 HTTP 409，且 4.50 不被覆盖
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{reviewResultId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 3,
  "expectedVersion": {{initialReviewVersion}}
}

### 8. 提交超过题目满分的分数；预期 HTTP 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{reviewResultId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 5.01,
  "expectedVersion": {{revisedReviewVersion}}
}

### 9. 再次执行普通自动评分；不得改变 actualScore、reviewStatus、version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{reviewSubmissionId}}/grading

### 10. 最终查询；应保持 actualScore=4.50、reviewStatus=CONFIRMED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{reviewSubmissionId}}/results

### 11. 完全重启 Spring Boot 后再次执行；审核结果应仍然存在
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{reviewSubmissionId}}/results
